          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣi-ram dhaar puɔɔkä mi gul gul täth kɛ yiëëth min yian, tëë kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl ŋɛpnikɛ, kä luëŋ jiɛcdɛ tëë kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ dhieec. Kä te buɔ̱lɛ kɛ bëër ti tekɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te thɛɛr wi̱cdɛ kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl ti go̱o̱l dhaar. Kä ca kɛ la̱t kɛ bëër rɛw ca kɛ ta̱th puɔ̱ɔ̱nydɛ mëë ta̱th kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca dhaar la̱th jɔk thääkni da̱ŋ wäl rɛw, ci diɔ̱k nhiamdiɛn riet kui̱c caam kä ci diɔ̱k tin kɔ̱ŋ nhiamdiɛn riet kui̱c cuëëc, kä ci diɔ̱k tin kɔ̱kiɛn nhiamdiɛn riet kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ, kä ci diɔ̱k tin kɔ̱ŋ nhiamdiɛn riet kui̱c konyä ca̱ŋ. Kä cikɛ jio̱kiɛn riet kä dhaar puɔɔkä kɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ce̱t dëlɛ dhar kɛ pät tetdä. Kä ca ŋɛ̈pdɛ la̱t ce̱tkɛ ŋɛ̈p lirä ce̱tdɛ kɛ gaak tualä, tëë kɛ gua̱th puɔɔkä ti bathdɔɔri rɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ cuŋni yieethä min yian da̱ŋ wäl la̱t. Tekɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ ŋuaan bärɛ, kä tëë kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ ŋuaan di̱tdɛ, kä bäriɛn nhial ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɔmɔ cua jɛn la̱t cuuŋni. Kä cakɛ lät kä këët ti ca la̱t puɔ̱ɔ̱nydiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kuɛ̈ɛ̈t tin te puɔ̱ny cuŋni, ce̱tkɛ kɛ lony, kɛ thääk, kɛ pua̱ny ti ce̱tkɛ pua̱ny jaakni. Kä piny lonyni kɛnɛ thääk kɛ nhialiɛn, ca lät kä mi ce̱tkɛ tak thaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn cuuŋni te mɔ kɛ ciök da̱ŋ ŋuaan yieethä min yian kɛ jiɛn ti wi̱el cio̱k thi̱n. Kä tuɔ̱ŋni da̱ŋ ŋuaan tekɛ ro̱o̱m thaak, ɛn ro̱o̱m ca la̱t kɛ yiëëth, kä cakɛ kɛt gëëkni kɛ kët mi ce̱tkɛ thac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣöŋ thuɔkdɛ min wä nhial ce̱tdɛ kɛ kum kuäärä tëë kɛ juäth tetdä kɛl kä thokdɛ ɛ gul gul kä tharɛ ɛ juäth tetdä kɛ nuth. Kä thokdɛ tekɛ kɛ̈t, kä kääpnikɛ kɛ puɔ̱r puɔ̱ɔ̱r /cikɛ guɔ̱l guɔ̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn ciök da̱ŋ ŋuaan tekɛ piny kääpni. Kä yiëëth in wi̱el cio̱k thi̱n kɛ kɛl kɛnɛ cuuŋni. Kä bär ciökä ɛ juäth tetdä kɛ nuth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn ciök cakɛ la̱t ce̱tkɛ ciök thurbiɛɛl ɛn min wi̱elɛ thi̱n, kɛnɛ jicdɛ, kɛ kääpdɛ, kɛn diaal la̱tkɛ kɛ kɛ yiëëth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te cuuŋ kɛl kɛ kääpni ŋuaan kä tuɔ̱ŋ da̱ŋ ŋuaan. Kɛn kääpni kɛ kɛl kɛ cuuŋni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nhial kääpä tëë kɛ yio̱m mi gul gul bärɛ tëë kɛ nuth jua̱th tetdä. Kä ɛn nhial kääpä kɛnɛ cuuŋdɛ kɛ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä piny cuuŋädɛ kɛnɛ kääpdɛ, cɛ kɛ kët pua̱ny ti ce̱tkɛ pua̱ny jaakni, kɛnɛ lony, kɛ dɛy nöör ce̱tnikɛ kam kä mɔ, kɛ tak thaac mi wilkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä nɔmɔ cuɛ cuuŋni da̱ŋ wäl la̱t, kä kɛn diaal ca kɛ la̱t ala ti cäät, kɛ jɛn ta̱a̱ ɛ kɛlɔ, kä päärkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ gua̱th puɔɔkä da̱ŋ wäl täth kɛ yiëëth in yian. Te gua̱th kɛl kɛ thääk puɔɔkä ti jiɛn ŋuaan, kä te kɛl kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ ŋuaan, kä cuuŋni da̱ŋ wäl te mɔ kɛ gua̱a̱th puɔɔkä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ cuuŋni da̱ŋ dhieec la̱th kui̱c cuëëc luaak, kä cuɛ dhieec tin kɔ̱ŋ la̱th kui̱c caam luak. Kä cuɛ dhaar puɔɔkä la̱th buɔ̱lä kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ cuëëc luaak kuɔth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tin la̱tkɛ rɛy luaak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣi-ram took kɛnɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱k kɛ kueŋni maac lɛni täth bä. Inɔ cuɛ cu thuɔ̱k kɛ lät diaal tëë lätdɛ kä kuäär ni Thɔ-lo-mon rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wääthni da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ took da̱ŋ rɛw tin te wi̱i̱ wääthni, kɛ wuɔ̱th da̱ŋ rɛw ti ca kɛt kɛ tak tin kuɔ̱mkɛ wuɔ̱th wääthni piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ dɛy nöör ti kur ŋuaan tin ca kɛ̈t takni da̱ŋ rɛw, kä ca ka car kɛ bëër rɛw ŋuääk kä kɛl, kɛ ɣöö bɛ took da̱ŋ rɛw tin kuɔ̱mkɛ wuɔ̱th wääthni piny kum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ cuuŋni da̱ŋ wäl kɛ took puɔɔkä da̱ŋ wäl wi̱i̱diɛn la̱t bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ dhaar puɔɔkä, kɛnɛ thääk da̱ŋ wäl rɛw täth pinydɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ took kɛnɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱k, kɛ kueenyni maac, kɛn kuak ti diaal ti̱ti̱ tekɛ luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kɛn tëë ci Ɣi-ram kɛ ta̱th kuäär ni Thɔ-lo-mon, kɛ yiëëth in yian mi riaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu kuäär kɛn ti diaal ti̱ti̱ täth rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Jɔr-dɛn kɛ mun ta̱th, kam Cu-koth kɛnɛ Dha-rɛ-than. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔ-lo-mon kuak päl a /ka̱n thɛm, kɛ ɣöö ŋuan kɛn ɛlɔ̱ŋ. /Ka̱n pek yieethä min yian min la̱tkɛ kɛ ŋa̱c.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
